<section class="hero mt-[3.3rem] mb-24">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <p><strong>Hey, I'm Fabio</strong></p>
      <p><strong>I build things for the web</strong> <span class="note note-2">15 years of this<br/>still learning</span></p>
      <p><strong>I like taking messy, complex information and making it useful</strong></p>
      <p><strong>I'm looking for my next remote role.</strong> <a href="mailto:fabio@fabiosouto.me">Let's talk?</a> <span class="note note-3">dev + product</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 1200px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.5vw, 2.925rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 0.75em;
    position: relative;
  }

  strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .note {
    font-family: var(--font-note);
    font-size: 0.5em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    position: absolute;
    margin-left: 1rem;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .note-2 {
    transform: rotate(1.5deg);
  }

  .note-3 {
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    p {
      font-size: clamp(1.575rem, 6.3vw, 2.025rem);
      margin-bottom: 1.25em;
    }

    .note {
      position: static;
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .note-2 {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
